    "text": "The integral <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>24</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>dx</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is equal to ______."
  },
